WEBVTT

00:54.644 --> 00:55.394
GRASP

02:26.569 --> 02:27.319
JOJO'S BIZARRE ADVENTURE
DIAMOND IS UNBREAKABLE

02:27.320 --> 02:29.447
<i>A demon's crept into
our everyday life</i>

02:29.530 --> 02:31.823
<i>It's about to take away
something precious</i>

02:31.866 --> 02:35.119
<i>Our peace has already
crumbled long ago</i>

02:35.870 --> 02:37.997
<i>So casually, so nonchalantly</i>

02:38.039 --> 02:40.416
<i>It's taken from us
before we know it</i>

02:40.458 --> 02:43.711
<i>If we want it back,
now's the chance</i>

02:43.920 --> 02:47.423
<i>With the sharpness of
the piercing arrow</i>

02:48.216 --> 02:51.636
<i>The beauty of two souls united</i>

02:51.719 --> 02:54.304
<i>Wherever you go, chase you</i>

02:54.388 --> 02:56.515
<i>Whenever, chase you</i>

02:56.557 --> 02:58.600
<i>I will chase you</i>

02:58.643 --> 03:00.269
<i>Nowhere to escape</i>

03:00.353 --> 03:02.938
<i>Start running, I will chase you</i>

03:02.980 --> 03:05.023
<i>Tomorrow, chase you</i>

03:05.066 --> 03:07.777
<i>My fists will be the one
to show you</i>

03:07.985 --> 03:12.485
<i>Tenacity decides
who will win or lose</i>

03:13.699 --> 03:18.199
<i>So I chase you</i>

03:21.374 --> 03:25.211
EPISODE 24
